    "created_at": "2015-10-06T12:11:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-06T12:11:24Z",
    "body": "The BugZ status of the 5 (so-called) \"HTML(5) APIs\" is: SSE (0), Messaging (0), Storage (0), Workers (1) and Sockets (4). \n\nWe (@sideshowbarker or some other staff) can and should now mark the first three above as \"HISTORICAL\" and disable write access. Is this what you want @annevk?\n\nI would be reluctant to do the same to Workers and Sockets until they have ZarroBoogs (f.ex. the open bugs are copied to Github and then closed).\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
